      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "a8b9c88",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft manufactures plastics that support safe, sustainable, and efficient water management. Our customers depend on us for durable, corrosion-resistant materials that improve performance in potable water, wastewater treatment, and reclamation systems.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Our plastics are lightweight, leak-free, and easy to install, reducing energy costs and extending system life. They are used in municipal water distribution, irrigation systems, desalination, and sewage treatment facilities. By replacing traditional metal piping, our materials conserve water, reduce pumping costs, and lower long-term maintenance. Plastic-Craft helps municipalities, contractors, and environmental operators achieve reliable infrastructure that protects public health and preserves resources.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d45669f",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
